{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "截距 b 对直线 y = 2x + b 的影响",
    "goals": [
      "理解常数项 b 在直线方程 y = 2x + b 中表示 y 轴交点的纵坐标",
      "观察当 b 增大或减小时，直线在平面直角坐标系中发生的上下平移现象"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "利用直角坐标系和动态一次函数图像直观呈现直线位置变化",
        "结合直梯在墙面上整体抬高与降低的比喻，形象解释斜率不变而截距变化时的平移特征",
        "通过单点代入验证代数与几何的一致性，并在课后设计练习巩固理解"
      ]
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "as": "number_01",
        "initial": 0,
        "min": -5,
        "max": 5,
        "label": "b",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.05
        }
      }
    ],
    "tasks": [
      {
        "as": "section-01-task-01",
        "prompt": "请拖动滑块，将截距 b 的值设置为 4。",
        "availability": {
          "kind": "after_lesson"
        },
        "hints": [
          "向右滑动滑块增加 b 的数值。",
          "直到看到直线与 y 轴交于点 (0, 4) 即可。"
        ],
        "hint_after_attempts": 2,
        "success_message": "太棒了！直线的倾斜程度完全没变，整体平移到了 (0, 4)。",
        "allowed_operations": [
          {
            "kind": "variable_change",
            "variable": "number_01",
            "controls": [
              "slider"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "completion": {
          "kind": "expression_target",
          "expression": "number_01",
          "value": 4,
          "tolerance": 0.025
        },
        "start": {
          "kind": "practice",
          "variables": [
            "number_01"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "探究截距 b 的几何意义及对直线整体上下平移的影响",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "嗨！我是豆豆。今天我们来看一次函数 y = 2x + b，特别看看常数项 b 改变时，这条直线到底会怎么动！",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "plot",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "函数图像",
                "axes": {
                  "x": {
                    "min": -4,
                    "max": 4,
                    "label": "x"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "min": -10,
                    "max": 10,
                    "label": "y"
                  }
                },
                "curves": [
                  {
                    "as": "primary-curve",
                    "expression": "((2)*(x))+(number_01)",
                    "label": "y = 2x + b"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-02",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "y = 2x + b"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "先把 x 代入 0，你看，2 乘以 0 还是 0，所以 y 就直接等于 b！这意味着，不管 b 是几，直线都稳稳穿过 y 轴上的点 (0, b)。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "截距的意义",
                "items": [
                  "当 x = 0 时，y = b",
                  "直线与 y 轴交于 (0, b)",
                  "斜率固定为 2，倾斜程度不变"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-02"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "关注直线与y轴的交点",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "我们可以把这条直线想象成靠在墙上的一架直梯。现在坡度是锁定的，当我们把 b 调大，比如升到 3，整架梯子就直直地向上抬高！",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_01",
              "value": 3,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "normal",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "如果我们把 b 减小到 -2，整条直线又平行地往下滑动，穿过 y 轴负半轴的 (0, -2)。斜率 2 没变，改变的只是它上下所在的高度。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_01",
              "value": -2,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "normal",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-05",
          "say": "轮到你亲自来试一试啦！请拖动滑块，把截距 b 调整到 4，看看梯子是不是正好抬到了 y 轴的刻度 4 处。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "继续观察当前画面",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "截距 b 决定了直线与 y 轴交点的位置 (0, b)。当斜率保持不变时，b 的变化表现为整条直线在平面直角坐标系中的上下平移。",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
